  "collective.voidvanguards.message.headnameexistget": "头颅名称“%s”不存在。你可以使用以下命令获取所有可能头颅的列表：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.originallocationsave": "原始位置不在存档数据中。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.removedtags": "已移除所有 %s 个标签。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.returnedoriginallocation": "已返回原始位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.entered_orbit.1": "你瞥见高空中有什么东西，它似乎正稳定地环绕世界运行。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.entered_orbit.2": "  也许你可以用望远镜看得更清楚些？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.explosion": "你突然看到一团能量爆炸从飞船中迸发而出！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.left_orbit": "一切又恢复了正常。那个物体一定离开了它的轨道。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.lost_focus": "当你把视线从天际飞船上移开时，那些细节也随之消失了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.more_detailed": "你看得越近，飞船显露的细节就越多。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.reset": "天际飞船的可见度已重置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.skyship.server_trigger": "%s 目睹了天空中的一场爆炸！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.teleportedvoidbornbase": "已传送到虚空裔基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.unablereturnplayer": "无法将玩家送回原始位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.usageheadlist": "用法：/%s head list",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.usageheadname": "用法：/%s head <名称> <数量>：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.1": "你好，%s。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.10": "……我们正在失去 %s……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.11": "……不，这不可能…… ……进入防御位置……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.12": "……在你身后……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.2": "我们一直在轨道上观察你的活动，也知道你注意到了我们。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.3": "哦，那场爆炸？别担心，我们都安然脱险了。但这也是你来到这里的原因之一。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.4": "你现在在我们的总部，离你称之为家的地方有几光分远。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.5": "不过也许该先做个自我介绍。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.6": "我们是前卫队。诸界与虚空的探索者，时间与空间的守护者。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.7": "你目睹的那场爆炸，是我们的敌人为摧毁我们所做努力的一部分。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.8": "如你所见，它没有成功，但在我们彻底消失之前，%s 是不会停手的。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.cosmos.initial.9": "我们需要你做的，是……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.home.initial.1": "你环顾四周。你回到了之前所在的地方。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.coordinates.1": "你必须摧毁位于以下位置的基地：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.coordinates.2": " %s",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.1": "%s？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.10": "等你准备好，就去这些坐标：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.11": "%s",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.12": "进入传送门。摧毁基地边缘的雷达。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.13": "小心。任务完成后我会与你联络。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.14": "祝你好运。通话结束。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.2": "你安全吗？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.3": "很高兴我能把你从空间站带走。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.4": "我们遭到了袭击。情况很艰难……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.5": "宇宙中的时间流逝方式不同。距我们上次见面已经过了一周。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.6": "我们的人……少了些。我们得以安葬了死者。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.7": "我想请你帮个忙。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.8": "我们探测到一个由 %s 的支持者运作的中转基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.radio.initial.9": "在那个基地失去作用之前，我不能再冒险传送了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.1": "%s，你做到了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.2": "雷达被摧毁后，我们得以突破 %s 的防御。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.3": "很高兴你没有上它们那些虚假承诺的当。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.4": "这是阻止它们推进永恒黑暗的极为重要的一步。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.5": "接下来交给我们，我会把你送回宇宙传送门。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBase.6": "感谢你的勇气，我会尽快联系你。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.1": "你为我们和这个世界立下了大功。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.2": "%s 的威胁暂时解决了，我们要前往另一个象限。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.3": "我想把这个给你：",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.4": " > 你获得了轨道应答器",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.5": "它赋予你在这颗星球与前卫空间站之间随意传送的能力。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.6": "你若愿意可以改造它，但请保持它可用。我们或许还需要它。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.7": "祝你未来的冒险顺利。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.vanguards.voidbornBaseDestroyed.8": "指挥官 %s 通话结束。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.1": "啊！你选择了暴力。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.2": "那就这样吧。愿这里成为你的葬身之地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.3": "虚空裔！进攻！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.attacked.4": " ~ 既然拒绝了提议，你仍然需要找到雷达并使其失效！ ~ ",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.breakblock.unable": "某种魔法力量阻止你破坏方块。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.placeblock.unable": "某种魔法力量阻止你放置方块。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarLever.flip": "你拉下拉杆，无视了所有安全规程。雷达滋滋作响，被你强制关停。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarLever.flip.unable": "雷达已损坏，拉杆卡住了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.0": "！雷达控制",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.1": "必须始终保持",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.2": "处于上方位置",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.base.radarSign.text.3": "！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterSuccess.again": "那种熟悉的被扭曲拉扯的感觉再次充满了你的意识。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterSuccess.first": "当你进入传送门时，你感到自己的存在穿越了空间与时间。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.enterUnable": "某种魔法力量阻止你进入传送门。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.cosmos_gate.mobsAround": "传送门周围现存的虚空裔阻止你进入！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.endAsteroid.1": "你回到了虚空裔小行星基地。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.endAsteroid.2": " 希望你做了正确的决定。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.1": "你做出了正确的选择。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.2": "给我一点时间追踪他们的位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.3": "我很快就会启动传送。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.givenradio.4": "我们走吧，好吗？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.1": "停下！请停下！",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.10": "你只需要把那台无线电交给我。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.11": " ~ 你可以选择攻击，或对着虚空裔领袖右键使用轨道无线电。由你决定。 ~ ",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.2": "你已经证明了自己足够有能力。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.3": "杀了我们也于事无补。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.4": "我们生于虚空，也必将再度崛起。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.5": "不过，如果我们能达成某种协议，双方都能从这局面中获益。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.6": "我能感觉到你身上有轨道无线电的痕迹。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.7": "有了它，我就能追踪前卫队的位置。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.8": "……我们就能除掉他们。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.initial.9": "这个基地、这颗小行星以及它的所有财富都将归你。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.1": "%s？你在这里做什么？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.10": "接下来交给我们。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.11": "好好享用这颗小行星吧。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.2": "虚空裔的雷达被摧毁了吗？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.3": "你……是怎么到这里的？",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.4": "……不，这不可能……",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.5": "你好，莱拉。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.6": "那台无线电是件非常有用的装备。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.7": "做你的对手一直很愉快。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.8": "现在是时候结束这一切了。",
  "collective.voidvanguards.message.voidborn.vanguardStation.9": "谢谢你，%s。",
